    "preamble": "Cheedella Koteswara Rao vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 20 July, 2022",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioner would submit that this is a covered matter in view of the earlier common order passed by this Court in Criminal Petition Nos.5421 of 2019 and batch, dated 18.12.2019 whereby this Court has [LEAKAGE_MASK] several F.I.Rs registered for the similar offences based on identical facts. Therefore, he would submit that the petitioner, who is similarly placed, is also entitled for quash of the F.I.R. So, he would pray for quash of the F.I.R., registered against the petitioner.",
